From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 14 Dec 2025 11:54:36 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 0321/5749] feat(background-agent): restrict tool access in
 subagent execution to prevent recursive calls
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Disable 'task' and 'call_omo_agent' tools in BackgroundManager
- Disable recursive background operation tools in call_omo_agent sync execution
- Prevents agents from spawning background tasks or calling themselves

🤖 GENERATED WITH ASSISTANCE OF [OhMyOpenCode](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-opencode)
